source: tests/cli_test.rs
expression: "golden(tmp.path(), &[\"--help\"])"
---
exit: 0
--- stdout ---
Multi-repo worktree orchestrator

Usage: git-forest [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  init                Initialize git-forest configuration
  new                 Create a new forest
  rm                  Remove a forest
  ls                  List all forests
  status              Show status of repos in a forest
  exec                Run a command in each repo of a forest
  agent-instructions  Print AI agent usage instructions
  version             Show version information
  reset               Remove all git-forest configuration, state, and forest directories
  update              Update git-forest to the latest version
  help                Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --json     
      --debug    
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version

For AI agent usage instructions: git forest agent-instructions
